<h3><span class="mw-headline" id="Objects">Objects</span></h3>
<ul><li> <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/BITM%20base.xls" title="BITM base.xls">BITM base.xls</a>      - item types</li>
