<h3><span class="mw-headline" id="Areas_and_plots">Areas and plots</span></h3>
<ul><li> <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Areadata.xls" title="Areadata.xls">areadata.xls</a>    - sets various properties for specific areas</li>
