<h3><span class="mw-headline" id="Extending_the_official_campaign">Extending the official campaign</span></h3>
<ul><li> <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/PRCSCR.xls" title="PRCSCR.xls">PRCSCR.xls</a> - "Post-Release Content Script" - specifies scripts to run when an area or area list is loaded or entered. (This file is not included with the game, but is a placeholder for any usermade one)</li></ul>
